@startuml Create Class Post by Teacher
actor Teacher
participant ": CreatePostModal " as CreatePostModal
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": PostController " as PostController
participant ": PostService " as PostService
participant ": PostRepository " as PostRepository
database Database

Teacher->CreatePostModal: 1. Teacher clicks to Create Post
    activate Teacher
    activate CreatePostModal

CreatePostModal->CreatePostModal: 2. Render Create Post Form

Teacher->CreatePostModal: 3. Fill Post Content

CreatePostModal->Router: 4. Send POST /api/post/create
    deactivate CreatePostModal
    activate Router

Router->PostController: 5. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate PostController

PostController->PostService: 6. Create Post Request
    deactivate PostController
    activate PostService

PostService->PostService: 7. Validate Post Content

PostService->PostRepository: 8. Create New Post
    activate PostRepository

PostRepository->Database: 9. Insert Post Record
    activate Database

Database-->PostRepository: 10. Post Created Successfully
    deactivate Database

PostRepository-->PostService: 11. Post Created
    deactivate PostRepository

PostService->PostService: 12. Process Post Data

PostService-->PostController: 13. Return Post Data
    deactivate PostService
    activate PostController

PostController-->Router: 14. Send Success Response
    activate Router
    deactivate PostController

Router-->CreatePostModal: 15. Post Created Successfully
    activate CreatePostModal
    deactivate Router

CreatePostModal->CreatePostModal: 16. Show Success Message

CreatePostModal->CreatePostModal: 17. Close Modal and Refresh Posts

CreatePostModal-->Teacher: 18. Show Updated Posts List
    deactivate CreatePostModal
    deactivate Teacher
@enduml
